  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jalam-Harfo Road Rehabilitation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall project objective is to support economic development in Somalia by improving the transport connectivity in the country.The Specific Objectives of the action:1.Is to rehabilitation of the Jalam-Harfo section of the Gaalkacyo-Garowe Road. 2.Is to improve the capacity of Puntland Highway Authority.Activities: 1.Rehabilitation of Jalam-Harfo section of the Gaalkacyo-Garowe Road2.Capacity Building of the Puntland Highway Authority</narrative>
  </description>
